    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29134" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσκατ-έργαστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to work</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					17.1.33
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρποὶ - <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότεροι</span></span>
			<i>slower to mature</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.14.4
			</span></i>; <i>hard of digestion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.244
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσκατάπρακτος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.2.7
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>hard to tame</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένος ταύρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agatharch.
					76
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); <i>hard to overcome</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tyr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>.</div>
